      "id": "9f630f3f-2c27-4fef-8f1e-373ba12fb69a",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": "### Test 1 - slideBack() cannot make progress go below zero\r\n#### What this test is checking\r\n\r\nThis test proves that a typist cannot move into negative progress after sliding back too far.",
      "metadata": {
        "language": "markdown",
        "id": "9f630f3f-2c27-4fef-8f1e-373ba12fb69a"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b3b6db9a-7268-4c8c-99fe-5c54cf2e68c4",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": "Typist typist1 = new Typist('①', \"RACER1\", 0.85);\r\n\r\nSystem.out.println(\"Initial progress: \" + typist1.getProgress());\r\n\r\ntypist1.typeCharacter();\r\ntypist1.typeCharacter();\r\nSystem.out.println(\"Progress after typing twice: \" + typist1.getProgress());\r\n\r\ntypist1.slideBack(5);\r\nSystem.out.println(\"Progress after slideBack(5): \" + typist1.getProgress());",
      "metadata": {
        "language": "java",
        "executionSummary": {
          "executionOrder": 34,
          "success": true
        }
      },
      "execution_count": 34,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "execute_result",
          "data": {
            "text/plain": "Initial progress: 0\r\nProgress after typing twice: 2\r\nProgress after slideBack(5): 0\r\n"
          },
          "metadata": {},
          "execution_count": 34
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "0a2d58ea-a62f-4201-b373-e17aafe46d5d",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": "### Test 2 - burnout counts down correctly and clears at zero\r\n#### What this test is checking\r\n\r\nThis test proves that:\r\n\r\n- burnout starts correctly\r\n- burnout turns reduce one by one\r\n- burnout is removed when the counter reaches zero",
      "metadata": {
        "language": "markdown",
        "id": "0a2d58ea-a62f-4201-b373-e17aafe46d5d"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6746b5d4-9d8b-4700-b358-6b6148bcf23e",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": "Typist typist2 = new Typist('②', \"RACER2\", 0.60);\r\n\r\ntypist2.burnOut(2);\r\n\r\nSystem.out.println(\"Burnt out? \" + typist2.isBurntOut());\r\nSystem.out.println(\"Turns remaining: \" + typist2.getBurnoutTurnsRemaining());\r\n\r\ntypist2.recoverFromBurnout();\r\nSystem.out.println(\"After one recovery:\");\r\nSystem.out.println(\"Burnt out? \" + typist2.isBurntOut());\r\nSystem.out.println(\"Turns remaining: \" + typist2.getBurnoutTurnsRemaining());\r\n\r\ntypist2.recoverFromBurnout();\r\nSystem.out.println(\"After second recovery:\");\r\nSystem.out.println(\"Burnt out? \" + typist2.isBurntOut());\r\nSystem.out.println(\"Turns remaining: \" + typist2.getBurnoutTurnsRemaining());",
      "metadata": {
        "language": "java",
        "executionSummary": {
          "executionOrder": 35,
          "success": true
        }
      },
      "execution_count": 35,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "execute_result",
          "data": {
            "text/plain": "Burnt out? true\r\nTurns remaining: 2\r\nAfter one recovery:\r\nBurnt out? true\r\nTurns remaining: 1\r\nAfter second recovery:\r\nBurnt out? false\r\nTurns remaining: 0\r\n"
          },
          "metadata": {},
